HANDLING & STORAGE
HANDLING: Mandatory and recommended industrial hygiene procedures should be followed whenever our products are
being handled and used. For additional information please read Material safety data sheets.
STORAGE: Product should be stored in a dry place in their original, properly closed containers at temperature between
2 - 40°C. Chemical should be consumed once opened
